// Secrets.xcconfig.template — copy to Secrets.xcconfig for local direct-mode dev.
// Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored and must never be committed.
//
// PRODUCTION uses no provider keys in the app: they live server-side in the
// Cloudflare Worker (see proxy/), and the app calls it via APIConfig.proxyBaseURL.
//
// You only need the keys below if you set APIConfig.proxyBaseURL = nil to run
// against the providers directly for local development. Doing so also requires
// restoring the FAL_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY entries in Info.plist.
//
// fal.ai key:  https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys
// Gemini key:  https://aistudio.google.com/apikey

// FAL_API_KEY = YOUR_FAL_AI_KEY_HERE
// GEMINI_API_KEY = YOUR_GEMINI_KEY_HERE
